scription": "# PLUNDR - EARLY ACCESS\n\n**Join our Discord at https://discord.gg/eU6zxp8agn for exclusive rewards, events and a unique role \u2694\ufe0f**\n\nStart with nothing but a shovel. End as a legend. Team up with up to 8 players, dig up rare keys, plunder chests full of loot and slay giant monsters together!\n\n\u26cf\ufe0f **Hunt for keys together** - Explore mysterious islands with your squad, fight the monsters guarding digging sites and dig up enchanted keys.\n\n{2353084168824180}\n\n\ud83d\udcb0 **Plunder epic loot** - Crack open chests to collect powerful weapons, abilities and skins.\n\n{29573483172248535}\n\n\ud83d\udcaa **Grow stronger** - Upgrade your arsenal through a full tech tree and become the strongest of raider.\n\n{1337422251821013}\n\n\ud83d\udc79 **Slay bosses together** - Join forces and take down massive monsters guarding the rarest treasure.\n\n{1189925477053809}\n\n\ud83c\udf7a **Flex in the tavern** - Meet other players, show off your loot and your style, and prove who's the greatest.", "short_description": "Plundr is a free VR multiplayer PvE adventure with gorilla movement. Team up with up to 8 players to explore mysterious islands, fight the monsters guarding digging sites and dig up enchanted keys. Crack open chests for powerful weapons, abilities and skins, upgrade your arsenal through a full tech tree, and take down giant bosses as a team. Then meet up in the tavern to show off your loot. Dig. Loot. Slay. Together. "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://plundrvr.com/#privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Atlas V", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://plundrvr.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2691890164460465"}, {"id": "821934236779161"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "3744040075834813"}, 